        "client_msg_id": "c51cb7e6-f386-45da-88e2-291391224b9e",
        "text": "<@U02E4DAQGSZ> Nice! :pray:\n\nIt's from 2012 so feels a bit dated. React/Vue/Svelte all happened afterwards.\n\nI came across this one from late 2024, though not a survey paper: <https://dl.acm.org/doi/pdf/10.1145/3689492.3690048>",
        "team": "T5TCAFTA9",
        "thread_ts": "1751954442.859169",
        "parent_user_id": "U018S42NMMM",
        "blocks": [
            {
                "type": "rich_text",
                "block_id": "pHlG2",
                "elements": [
                    {
                        "type": "rich_text_section",
                        "elements": [
                            {
                                "type": "user",
                                "user_id": "U02E4DAQGSZ"
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": " Nice! "
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "emoji",
                                "name": "pray",
                                "unicode": "1f64f"
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "text",
                                "text": "\n\nIt's from 2012 so feels a bit dated. React/Vue/Svelte all happened afterwards.\n\nI came across this one from late 2024, though not a survey paper: "
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "link",
                                "url": "https://dl.acm.org/doi/pdf/10.1145/3689492.3690048"
